187 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (Big update here is that old items can be zapped and boosted \(or re-lit\) back into ranking high in lit, what we formerly called hot. Items in lit are ranked based on when they receive "investment" \(zaps, boost, etc\), not when they are created. New investment on an old item will cause the item to move up in lit ranking and it will compete with other items receiving investment around the same time.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [20]
>>
