/P 139 0 R
/E (Mochi gives every creator a public page. Anyone with a Lightning wallet can tip you by scanning a QR code, no account needed, no friction. When someone wants to subscribe or buy something you made, they load sats into their Mochi wallet, a prepaid balance that keeps subscriptions running without expired cards or chargebacks or banks in the way. You log in with a seed phrase. No email, no KYC.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
